{"id":"1011326379eaea3c","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-silver-indestructible.md","title":"Silver's Theorem","display":"thm-silver-indestructible — Silver's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-silver-indestructible","aliases":["58-thm-silver-indestructible"],"display":"thm-silver-indestructible — Silver's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-singular]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-silver-indestructible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-silver-indestructible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-silver-indestructible — Silver's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular\">../batch04/58-df-singular</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (singular cardinal of uncountable cofinality)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sing}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sing}\\)</span> (singular-cardinal predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality function)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}silver\\text{-}indestructible}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\leq\\lambda\n\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to2^\\kappa=\\kappa^+.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}silver\\text{-}indestructible}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\leq\\lambda\n\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to2^\\kappa=\\kappa^+.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Silver's theorem says that, at a singular cardinal of uncountable cofinality, GCH below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> entails SCH at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Equivalently, the first failure of GCH cannot occur at such a singular cardinal; this is not a forcing-indestructibility claim.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-singular","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-singular]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sing}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}silver\\text{-}indestructible}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega<\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\lambda<\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\leq\\lambda\n\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to2^\\kappa=\\kappa^+.","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1179,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4419","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-silver-indestructible.md|58-thm-silver-indestructible]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["02120307ea943054","5fb1c2241d1943d1","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}